message: If you use this guide, please cite it as below.
title: "Starting a business in the UK: the whole journey"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Silva
    given-names: Emanuel
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0000-5880-7219
repository-code: https://github.com/cyberdudeuk/start-a-business-uk
url: https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/start-a-business-uk/
abstract: >-
  An evidence-led guide to starting and running a business in the UK across every step, public body, rule and
  nation, with a founder's plan, tailored circumstances, a four-nations and international comparison, service
  blueprints, a knowledge layer and a verification register tracing every claim to its source. A prototype, not an
  official government service.
keywords: [starting a business, UK government, public services, regulation, service design, open data]
